		{
			dependencies: ["4EAA9A43A9020901"]
			description: [
				"Heat zinc and copper in a basin to make brass. Brass components enable smarter logistics and precision mechanisms."
				"Brass is the boundary between basic motion and precise logistics. Secure a safe Blaze Burner workflow, check heating requirements in JEI, and keep zinc, copper, and andesite components stocked before scaling production."
				"Precision Mechanisms are sequenced-assembly products: the item must pass through the required operations in order, often several times. Ponder the recipe and provide a safe return loop rather than relying on loose items."
				"Steam power depends on a complete boiler: heat, water, enough tank volume, and correctly attached engines. Read every gauge before increasing size, and keep fuel and water failure modes accessible."
			]
			id: "3C8A246AFBC5BCB3"
